    <!-- EN: raidArrivedLetterText-&gt;A group of deserters have arrived to attempt to disrupt the grand ball and assassinate the royals.\n\n[asker_nameFull] does not care for the threat and demands the ball continues! [asker_pronoun] wants you to keep them safe and deal with the "peasants". -->
    <li>raidArrivedLetterText-&gt;Um grupo de desertores chegou para tentar atrapalhar o grande baile e assassinar os nobres.\n\n[asker_nameFull] não liga para a ameaça e exige que o baile continue! Quer que vocês protejam os nobres e deem um jeito nos "camponeses".</li>
    <!-- EN: BallSuccessLetterLetterLabel-&gt;Grand ball success -->
    <li>BallSuccessLetterLetterLabel-&gt;Sucesso no grande baile</li>
    <!-- EN: BallSuccessLetterText-&gt;The shuttle has departed with [asker_nameFull] and [asker_possessive] guests. Overall the event was a success and everyone made it back safe. -->
    <li>BallSuccessLetterText-&gt;O ônibus espacial partiu com [asker_nameFull] e os convidados. No geral, o evento foi um sucesso e todos voltaram em segurança.</li>
